Rewards
    Give 1 of 910234000

On available
    If player is karus
        Say "You saying that to listen to the story [Eslant Wise Man]Pablo. It must be some big secret?"
        Topic "All right, I'll swing by" goto close
    If player is elmorad
        Say "You saying that listen to a story by [Eslant Wise Man]Agata. It must be some big secret?"
        Topic "All right, I'll swing by" goto close

On offer
    If player is karus
        Say "You have heard the story, where she is, but I'll say it again."
        Topic "Tell me more..." do
            Show quest "The letter you recovered ... She contains huge. Mar barbarian king room and tossed through the life of many allies in the name of the traitor.\n\nPrivate feelings should be Knew the usual timid line, to risk so much that I did not know that. Nowhere, I'll give you in this article. Nature of advisor to the guy passed me. The selfishness of the human that you are, yeah ... What is so scary\n\nThis is really important that you do not tell anyone. Talk to Pablo."
    If player is elmorad
        Say "You have heard the story, where she is, but I'll say it again."
        Topic "Tell me more..." do
            Show quest "The letter you recovered ... She contains huge. Mar barbarian king room and tossed through the life of many allies in the name of the traitor.\n\nPrivate feelings should be Knew the usual timid line, to risk so much that I did not know that. Nowhere, I'll give you in this article. Nature of advisor to the guy passed me. The selfishness of the human that you are, yeah ... What is so scary\n\nThis is really important that you do not tell anyone. Talk to Agatha."

On claimable
    Show quest "[Advisor] I'm always preach to him. Souls died with it ought to be good, but you have to take a rest ..."

